%% HTTP prefix: /api/v1. API lane includes verified middleware and errorHandler.
%% Grouped read and validation calls short-circuit on error. No Repository layer is implied.
%% Same tier queues at current end, immediate upgrade replaces current entitlement, downgrade waits until current end.
%% No free-standing Payment SUCCESS endpoint is used.
sequenceDiagram
    actor A as Receptionist
    participant UI as MembershipPage
    participant API as Express middleware / errorHandler
    participant C as subsController
    participant S as subscriptionsService
    participant DB as Prisma / PostgreSQL

    A->>UI: Confirm paid membership sale after actual collection
    UI->>API: POST /api/v1/subscriptions
    activate API
    API->>API: authenticate, checkFacilityScope, authorize(MANAGER, RECEPTIONIST), validate request
    alt request guard rejects
        API-->>UI: 400 / 401 / 403 error
    else request accepted
        API->>C: createSubscription(req, res, next)
        activate C
        C->>S: createSubscription(data, creatorId)
        activate S
        S->>DB: Read active member and active paid plan, inspect purchase rules under member lock
        activate DB
        DB-->>S: Requested records and validation context
        deactivate DB
        S->>S: Use authoritative price and validate NEW / UPGRADE / DOWNGRADE / RENEW_SAME_TIER
        S->>S: Only one current active and at most one scheduled paid period
        alt invalid member / plan, queued paid period or invalid activation date
            S-->>C: 400 / 404 / 409
        else business conditions satisfied
            S->>DB: In transaction persist subscription, collected SUCCESS payment, invoice and notification outbox
            activate DB
            DB-->>S: Saved result
            deactivate DB
            S-->>C: Subscription and financial receipt
        end
        deactivate S
        C-->>API: response or next(error)
        deactivate C
        API-->>UI: 201 result or mapped error
    end
    deactivate API
    UI-->>A: Show result or actionable error

